== Walkthrough ==

''[[Theron Rolius]] is found in the Hall of Truth at (1100, -128).''  

Faction Note:  I believe (will edit if I kill enough orcs or get there) this requires amiable faction with [[Knights of Truth]] otherwise you get the following from the milk bottle hand in:  "Mojax Hikspin says, 'You have yet to earn my trust.'"  All dialog works as apprehensive.

You say, 'Hail, Theron Rollius!'

: Theron Rollius says, 'Greetings, ______! To enter these grounds is to proclaim your faith in the Truthbringer. In this city you shall find no greater allies than the Knights of Truth. We urge all knights and clerics who oppose the hand of the Freeport Militia to [join the crusade].'

You say, 'I will join the crusade.'

: Theron Rollius says, 'Then take arms against the Freeport Militia! They serve no one save Sir Lucan, the fallen knight. From this day forth, I put a bounty upon all militia members. For every bashed militia helm, a reward!! If you are not prepared to battle the militia just yet, you may [assist in other areas].'

You say, 'How can I assist in other areas?'

: Theron Rollius says, 'I have need of one such as you. I have been awaiting a message. I will need a young acolyte to [retrieve the message] for me or there are also some [fishing duties] I wish to delegate.'

You say, 'I will retrieve the message for you.'

: Theron Rollius says, 'Thank you. Venture to the Commonlands. There, by a lake, will be a courier from the great city of Qeynos. Tell him you are from the Hall of Truth. He will have a message for you to deliver to Eestyana Naestra.'

'''Travel to [[West Commonlands]] to find the courier. [[Mojax Hikspin]] is located at 109, 2339'''

You say, 'Hail, Mojax Hikspin!'

: Mojax Hikspin says, 'Hi. How are you? The fish are biting pretty good. That is whay Skipynn tells me. I sure wish I had a different job. If I did, I could fish all day long.'

You say, 'What is your job?'

: Mojax Hikspin says, 'I am a messenger for [Antonius Bayle], ruler of the great city of [Qeynos].'

You say, 'I am from the Hall of Truth.'

: Mojax Hikspin says, 'I have been expecting you. I am very parched. Could you please get me a bottle of milk? Once you do that will show you where I hid the note.'

'''Give a [[Bottle of Milk]] to Mojax Hikspin.'''

: Mojax Hikspin says, 'Aaahhhh. Now that is refreshing. Just let me rest for a bit. The note is save and sound in my bedroll inside the inn.'

