'''Wait approximately one minute for Mojax to rest. He will then start walking toward the Toll Booth. At some point during the walk, [[Duggin Scumber]] will run up and steal the [[Note]]''' {{Item Lore | Note To Hall Of Truth}}.

: Duggin Scumber says, 'Aha!! Foolish Qeynite or whatever you call yourself!! I have found the note and now I shall take it to my superior!! Just try and catch me!!'

''Duggin Scumber is a fast runner. If you cannot keep up with him, use root, snare, or a ranged weapon to stop him for battle.''

: Duggin Scumber says, 'Die, dog!!'

<div class="facblock">
